  "settingsRemoveAllAppDataTitle": "Remove all app data?",
  "settingsRemoveAllAppDataBody": "This removes everything: your photos, albums, people, sync queue, and bucket connections with their keys. The app will be as if newly installed.\n\nA copy is saved first, with pre-deletion in its file name. It goes on this iPhone, and to iCloud Drive and your buckets if they can still be reached.\n\nChoose whether to keep the hidden photos stored on this iPhone or remove them too. Kept photos stay encrypted and open again with your passphrase and code. Hidden photos already in your buckets are never touched.",
