  "devJobsHow": "• Made on the Mac.\n• Before importing, you'll see every job and its dates. You choose whose history it is.\n• A job with the same employer and start year is replaced. Others are added. Nothing is removed.",
  "devJobsSpec": "File: .json with a \"jobs\" list.\n\n• Required: employer.\n• start, end: yyyy, yyyy-mm or yyyy-mm-dd; end null or \"present\" is ongoing.\n• notes; fields (label, value).\n• titles (title, description, start, end), projects (name, description, tags, start, end), awards (title, description, start, end).",
